<html lang="zh-CN"><head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Vivienne · Portfolio 2026</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        :root {
            --primary: #1a1a1a;       /* dark for headers/titles */
            --secondary: #333333;     /* dark gray */
            --accent: #c4302b;        /* red — decorative bars/borders only */
            --bg: #fafaf9;            /* warm off-white, card-like */
            --card: #ffffff;
            --text: #1a1a1a;          /* near-black body text */
            --text-light: #333333;    /* dark gray for secondary text */
            --border: #e5e5e5;        /* neutral light border */
            --editor-bg: #f5f5f4;
            --editor-border: #d4d4d4;
            --selected: #f59e0b;      /* keep amber for editing UI */
        }
        .data-red {
            color: #c4302b;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'PingFang SC', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        .hero {
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            padding: 60px 24px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 0;
        }
        .hero .card-img {
            display: block;
            max-width: 900px;
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
        }
        .hero h1 { font-size: 42px; margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 800; }
        .hero .title { font-size: 18px; opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .resume {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 32px;
            max-width: 520px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
        }
        .resume-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr;
            gap: 16px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .resume-grid span:first-child { opacity: 0.8; font-weight: 500; }
        .resume-grid span:last-child { font-weight: 600; }
        .container { max-width: 960px; margin: -60px auto 0; padding: 0 24px; position: relative; z-index: 10; }
        .section {
            background: var(--card);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
            position: relative;
        }
        .section-header {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid var(--border);
            position: relative;
        }
        .section-header h2 {
            font-size: 26px;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .section-header::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -3px;
            left: 0;
            width: 80px;
            height: 3px;
            background: var(--accent);
            border-radius: 2px;
        }
        .project { margin-bottom: 56px; }
        .project:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
        .project-tag {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #fef2f2;
            color: #c4302b;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .project-title {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            color: var(--text);
        }
        .project-info {
            background: var(--bg);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .project-info h4 {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .project-info p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #4b5563;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .project-info p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
        .project-info ul { padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 8px; }
        .project-info li { font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .project-info blockquote {
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
            padding: 12px 16px;
            margin: 16px 0;
            background: rgba(196, 48, 43, 0.04);
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #6b7280;
        }
        .img-group {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .img-item {
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
            cursor: zoom-in;
        }
        .img-item:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.12); }
        .img-item img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
        .img-full {
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            position: relative;
            cursor: zoom-in;
        }
        .img-full img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
        .video-group {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .video-group-1 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .video-group-3 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .video-item {
            background: #1a1a1a;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
            cursor: zoom-in;
        }
        .video-item:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
        .video-item video {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
            max-height: 380px;
            object-fit: contain;
        }
        .video-label {
            padding: 12px 16px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
            font-size: 13px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .highlight {
            background: #fef2f2;
            border: 1px solid #f0c0bd;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .highlight h4 {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #c4302b;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .highlight li { font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .divider {
            height: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--border), transparent);
            margin: 48px 0;
        }
        .other-title {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            padding-left: 12px;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
        }
        .gallery-group {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(170px, 1fr));
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }
        .gallery-item {
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
            cursor: zoom-in;
        }
        .gallery-item:hover { transform: scale(1.05); }
        .gallery-item img { width: 100%; height: 140px; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
        .section-title-3 {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        footer {
            background: var(--text);
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 48px 24px;
            margin-top: 48px;
        }
        footer p { font-size: 14px; }

        [] {
            outline: 2px dashed transparent;
            padding: 4px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: text;
        }
        []:hover {
            outline-color: rgba(196, 48, 43, 0.3);
            background: rgba(196, 48, 43, 0.04);
        }
        []:focus {
            outline-color: var(--primary);
            background: rgba(196, 48, 43, 0.08);
        }
        [].editing {
            outline-color: var(--selected);
            background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.1);
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
    
        /* ==== v7: video-only interactions ==== */
        .video-item { position: relative; }
        .video-fs-btn {
            position: absolute;
            top: 10px;
            right: 10px;
            width: 34px;
            height: 34px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: none;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
            color: #fff;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            z-index: 10;
            padding: 0;
            transition: background 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
            backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
        }
        .video-fs-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(196, 48, 43, 0.9);
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
        .video-fs-btn svg {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            display: block;
            fill: none;
            stroke: currentColor;
            stroke-width: 2;
            stroke-linecap: round;
            stroke-linejoin: round;
        }
        /* Images: normal display, no cursor hint, no click behavior */
        .img-item, .img-full, .gallery-item { cursor: default; }
        .hero .card-img { cursor: default; }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="hero">
        <img class="card-img" src="assets/hero-card.png"" alt="名片">
    </div>

    <div class="container" id="main-container">
        <section class="section">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2>AI Designer | ByteDance | 2023–2026</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="project" draggable="true">
                <span class="project-tag">核心项目</span>
                <h3 class="project-title">轻颜/抖音 AI 写真（2023-2024）</h3>
                <div class="project-info">
                    <h4>背景：轻颜AI写真项目于23年7月立项，11/3上线，11/20开始陆续推广，是公司首个带有分身的真人AI生成玩法。</h4>
                    
                    <h4>成果：公司首个真人 AI 玩法 —— 端内拉新完成度 <span class="data-red">900%</span>、DNU 环比 <span class="data-red">+28%</span>、主话题 VV <span class="data-red">3.1 亿</span>、累计拉新拉活 <span class="data-red">1500 万 +</span>; 口碑超越妙鸭等竞品；App Store 免费榜 <span class="data-red">73 → 17</span>。</h4>
                    
                    <h4>主要职责：从 0-1 跑通 AI 形象链路，主攻 ID 保持痛点，统筹数据筛选、风格打磨与模型训练全流程。</h4>
                    
                </div>

                <h4 class="section-title-3">产品链路</h4>
                <div class="img-group">
                    <div class="img-item">
                        <img src="assets/截屏2026-07-22%2015.35.16.png" alt="">
                    </div>
                    
                    
                </div>

                <h4 class="section-title-3">效果打磨与沉淀 SOP</h4>
                <div class="highlight">
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>用户相似度：</strong>WebUI 搭建全链路，优化分身与风格 LoRA、利用 IP-Adapter 将身份特征注入，和 ControlNet 配合，锁定角色的 IP 外观和人物长相。</li>
                        <li><strong>写真风格：</strong>聚焦胶片风格，还原胶片系列的色调、质感、光圈，人物情绪、姿态等，通过效果突破刺激用户的视觉体验与新鲜感，最终达成爆款出圈。</li>
                        <li><strong>SOP沉淀：</strong>轻颜 AI 写真作为自研全新链路首次在业务中落地，在效果上线后，同步梳理制定了真人 LORA 的制作标准，建立起轻颜 AI 写真 SOP，为后续 AI 形象进抖音打下良好基础。</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="img-full">
                    <img src="assets/7月22日%281%29.gif" alt="">
                </div>

                <h4 class="section-title-3">口碑出圈与影响力</h4>
                <p style="font-size:14px;color:#4b5563;margin-bottom:16px;">轻颜AI写真相关话题 #这个胶片的杀伤力不亚于初恋、#看看你的AI美式学院照，分别登上抖音挑战榜 TOP1、抖音热榜 TOP1。引发评论区跟风晒图持续带动跟投，用户口碑表现佳，整体超出预期。</p>
                <div class="img-full">
                    <img src="assets/7月22日%282%29.gif" alt="">
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <div class="project" draggable="true">
                <span class="project-tag">特效玩法</span>
                <h3 class="project-title">AI 音乐（2024-2025）</h3>
                <div class="project-info">
                    <h4>背景：预期通过AI音乐生成能力拓展 AI 特效的品类及玩法，以新的交互方式降低用户创作门槛，促进用户创意表达，带动投稿和内容消费价值的提高。</h4>
                    
                    <h4>成果：跑通 AI 音乐生成全链路，「AI 我的新年单曲」达成年轻 <span class="data-red">S-</span>、消费 <span class="data-red">S- 爆款</span></h4>
                    
                    <h4>主要职责：特效交互与内容设计，编写 PE 把控 AI 生成音乐与歌词质量</h4>
                    
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>降低创作门槛：</strong>通过图片投稿切入，提供命题制定方式降低文本创作难度</li>
                        <li><strong>歌词要素分类：</strong>按 场景 / 主题 / 事件 / 情感 / 人物 五大分类，以内容识别替代文本输入，丰富歌词内容</li>
                        <li><strong>玩法包装：</strong>采用音乐专辑的形式，多图上传 + 黑胶唱片包装形式，突出音乐原创</li>
                    </ul>
                    <blockquote>洞察热点反哺特效，同年 AI 歌曲"还我妈生鼻"爆火，我们将 "音" 引入 "文、图、视频" 的生成链路，通过<strong>歌曲创作</strong>和<strong>音色克隆</strong>两大方向拓展 AI 特效品类，降低用户创作门槛，带动投稿与内容消费。</blockquote>
                </div>

                <div class="img-group">
                    <div class="img-item">
                        <img src="assets/截屏2026-07-22%2016.27.07.png" alt="">
                    </div>
                    <div class="img-item">
                        <img src="assets/截屏2026-07-22%2016.06.42.png" alt="">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h4 class="section-title-3">效果展示</h4>
                <div class="img-group">
                    
                    <div class="img-item">
                        <img src="assets/11.jpg" alt="">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="video-group">
                    <div class="video-item">
                        <video style="width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;" preload="metadata"><source src="assets/ScreenRecording_01-07-2025 15-56-24_1.mov" type="video/quicktime"><source src="assets/ScreenRecording_01-07-2025 15-56-24_1.mov" type="video/mp4">您的浏览器不支持视频播放</video>
                        <div class="video-label">演示视频 1</div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="video-item">
                        <video style="width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;"><source src="assets/20250106-193301.mp4" type="video/mp4">您的浏览器不支持视频播放</video>
                        <div class="video-label">演示视频 2</div>
                    </div>
                    
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <div class="project" draggable="true">
                <span class="project-tag">特效玩法</span>
                <h3 class="project-title">AI 风格化（2024-2025）</h3>
                <div class="project-info">
                    <h4>背景：丰富抖音特效生态，产出高质量风格化特效带动投稿</h4>
                    
                    <h4>成果：「彩铅风」达成大盘 <span class="data-red">A 级</span>投稿爆款、消费 <span class="data-red">S- 级爆款</span></h4>
                    
                    <h4>主要职责：独立搭建效果生成链路，LoRA 数据优化，分场景精细调参，高效高标准把控效果上线</h4>
                    
                </div>

                <h4 class="section-title-3">基础 workflow 搭建</h4>
                <div class="img-full">
                    <img src="assets/截屏2026-07-22%2018.56.49.png" alt="">
                </div>

                <h4 class="section-title-3">效果展示</h4>
                <div class="img-full">
                    <img src="assets/截屏2026-07-22%2017.03.45.png" alt="">
                </div>
                <div class="video-group">
                    <div class="video-item">
                        <video style="width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;"><source src="assets/7%E6%9C%8822%E6%97%A5%288%29.mp4" type="video/mp4">您的浏览器不支持视频播放</video>
                        <div class="video-label">彩铅风演示 1</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="video-item">
                        <video style="width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;"><source src="assets/7%E6%9C%8822%E6%97%A5%287%29.mp4" type="video/mp4">您的浏览器不支持视频播放</video>
                        <div class="video-label">彩铅风演示 2</div>
                    </div>
                    
                </div>
                
            </div>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <div class="project" draggable="true">
                <span class="project-tag">探索项目</span>
                <h3 class="project-title">成片 Agent（2024-2025）</h3>
                <div class="project-info">
                    <h4>背景：探索型预期，利用 AI 能力，帮助用户实现有叙事感、多场景的用户作品创作。实现如下效果突破：</h4>
                    
                    <ul>
                        <li>相册理解与聚合，实现基于相册反推或已有主题，以叙事合集方式进行内容聚合</li>
                        <li>成片效果，支持生成图集/视频体裁作品，其中视频首创动态模板，覆盖主要叙事结构</li>
                    </ul>
                    <h4>成果：实现对相册内容的理解聚合、有叙事感的作品创作，达用户满意度评分 <span class="data-red">≥ 4分</span>（满分5分）</h4>
                    
                    <h4>主要职责：基于内容理解落地 基础策略、用户画像、AI端到端 三种聚合策略，初步实现多类型合集供给；搭建从素材编排 → 文案生成 → 本地成片的完整链路，完成故事线文案效果定义，构建文风观点库提升整体成片文案满意度。</h4>
                    
                </div>

                <div class="img-group">
                    <div class="img-item">
                        <img src="assets/截屏2026-07-22%2017.59.54.png" alt="">
                    </div>
                    <div class="img-item">
                        <img src="assets/截屏2026-07-22%2017.57.40.png" alt="">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h4 class="section-title-3">产品链路</h4>
                <div class="img-group">
                    <div class="img-item">
                        <img src="assets/image%201.png" alt="">
                    </div>
                    
                    
                    
                    
                </div>

                <h4 class="section-title-3">2 项专利</h4>
                <div class="highlight">
                    <h4>观点库 RAG (专利参与)：发明「基于观点库提升 AI 内容生成多样性的方法及系统」，通过主题匹配、关键词检索、多模态语义解析动态注入观点，解决 AI 生成同质化问题。</h4>
                    
                </div>
                <div class="img-full">
                    <img src="assets/截屏2026-07-22%2018.02.48.png" alt="">
                </div>

                <div class="highlight">
                    <h4>动态模板系统 (专利参与)：发明「基于素材特征理解的 AI 视频模板动态生成方案」，大模型 PE 编排故事线，实现素材数量与模板自动匹配，支持自动旁白、智能配乐与多维兜底。</h4>
                    
                </div>
                <div class="img-full">
                    <img src="assets/截屏2026-07-22%2018.01.50.png" alt="">
                </div>

                <h4 class="section-title-3">效果展示</h4>
                <div class="video-group-3">
                    
                    <div class="video-item">
                        <video style="width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;" preload="metadata"><source src="assets/%E9%A3%9E%E4%B9%A620250926-114530.mp4" type="video/mp4">您的浏览器不支持视频播放</video>
                        <div class="video-label">成片演示 1</div>
                    </div>
                    
                    
                    <div class="video-item">
                        <video style="width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;" preload="metadata"><source src="assets/%E9%A3%9E%E4%B9%A620250924-011645.mp4" type="video/mp4">您的浏览器不支持视频播放</video>
                        <div class="video-label">成片演示 2</div>
